        "original_id": "a05d484b-2060-5bca-a68a-9b3acd8eb769",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Les Clark, Ub Iwerks, Walt Disney\n- Projects: Mickey Mouse, Oswald the Lucky Rabbit, Plane Crazy\n- Roles: animator, cartoonist, character designer, inventor, special effects technician, director\n\nFacts:\n- In 1927, Les Clark joined Disney.\n- Les Clark was the only person besides Ub Iwerks to work on the origins of Mickey Mouse.\n- Ub Iwerks was an American animator, cartoonist, character designer, inventor, and special effects technician.\n- Ub Iwerks created Oswald the Lucky Rabbit with Walt Disney.\n- Ub Iwerks created Mickey Mouse with Walt Disney.\n- Plane Crazy is an American animated short film.\n- Plane Crazy was directed by Walt Disney and Ub Iwerks.",
